## 10. Final auditor statement

PASS.

Zero Trust Supplier Payment WOW v0.1 passes technical audit for a
deterministic local sandbox business-semantic runner. It demonstrates supplier
payment / shipment release review through fake local evidence, DRS-like
candidate context, vector/ranking/advisory semantics, bounded actor routing,
child branch report return, and Post V&V / GT / Root review boundaries. It
creates only a local mock receipt in the mock-approved scenario after Root
review and never represents it as real payment, real shipment release,
settlement, connector result, or bank confirmation. Root remains final
authority.
